WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
America is blessed with the strongest economy,

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.120
the strongest borders, the strongest military,

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.920
the strongest friendships,

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.920
and the strongest spirit of any nation on the face of the Earth.

